Date: Mon, 12 Jan 2026 09:14:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] Add Money value type, clock and error hierarchy

Money stores Decimal amounts with an explicit currency and only rounds
when asked. allocate() splits an amount across weights without losing a
minor unit. Clocks are injectable so time-dependent code is testable.
